NeoStego authors and contributors
==================================

NeoStego is a downstream fork of OpenStego.

Original work (OpenStego)
-------------------------
Samir Vaidya <syvaidya@gmail.com>
  Original author and copyright holder of OpenStego (https://www.openstego.com),
  from which NeoStego is derived. The majority of the core data-hiding
  framework, plugin SPI, and the legacy LSB/DWT plugins originate from his work.

NeoStego fork
-------------
Nick Haghiri <ns.haghiri@gmail.com>
  Fork maintainer. Author of the NeoStego-specific changes: the Android app,
  the content-adaptive (HILL+STC) and SI-UNIWARD plugins, the DWT-SVD
  watermarking plugin, the pure-Java JPEG and WAV codecs, the modernized
  desktop UI, the strengthened encryption, and the :core/:desktop module split.
  See CHANGELOG.md for details.

Third-party code
----------------
Peter Meerwald
  The legacy spread-spectrum DWT watermarking plugins (Dugad, Kim, Xie) are
  based on code from his thesis "Digital Image Watermarking in the Wavelet
  Transfer Domain" (University of Salzburg, 2001).
